{"slug":"d-b-r","ar":"د ب ر","total":44,"core":"back; end; planning","forms":[{"ar":"دُبُر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":18,"gloss":"back","word":null,"ex":{"s":54,"a":45,"p":4,"ar":["سَيُهْزَمُ","ٱلْجَمْعُ","وَيُوَلُّونَ","ٱلدُّبُرَ"],"en":"[Their] assembly will be defeated, and they will turn their backs [in retreat]"}},{"ar":"مُدْبِر","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":8,"gloss":"turning back, fleeing","word":null,"ex":{"s":37,"a":90,"p":3,"ar":["فَتَوَلَّوْا۟","عَنْهُ","مُدْبِرِينَ"],"en":"So they turned away from him, departing"}},{"ar":"أَدْبَرَ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":4,"gloss":"to turn back","word":null,"ex":{"s":74,"a":23,"p":2,"ar":["ثُمَّ","أَدْبَرَ","وَٱسْتَكْبَرَ"],"en":"Then he turned back and was arrogant"}},{"ar":"دَابِر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"last remnant, root","word":null,"ex":{"s":6,"a":45,"p":2,"ar":["فَقُطِعَ","دَابِرُ","ٱلْقَوْمِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ظَلَمُوا۟ ۚ","وَٱلْحَمْدُ","لِلَّهِ","رَبِّ","ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ"],"en":"So the people that committed wrong were eliminated. And praise to Allah, Lord of the worlds"}},{"ar":"يَتَدَبَّرُ","kind":"verb","form":5,"count":4,"gloss":"to ponder","word":null,"ex":{"s":47,"a":24,"p":2,"ar":["أَفَلَا","يَتَدَبَّرُونَ","ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","أَمْ","عَلَىٰ","قُلُوبٍ","أَقْفَالُهَآ"],"en":"Then do they not reflect upon the Qur'an, or are there locks upon [their] hearts"}},{"ar":"يُدَبِّرُ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":4,"gloss":"to direct, arrange","word":null,"ex":{"s":32,"a":5,"p":1,"ar":["يُدَبِّرُ","ٱلْأَمْرَ","مِنَ","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","إِلَى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","ثُمَّ","يَعْرُجُ","إِلَيْهِ","فِى","يَوْمٍ","كَانَ","مِقْدَارُهُۥٓ","أَلْفَ","سَنَةٍ","مِّمَّا","تَعُدُّونَ"],"en":"He arranges [each] matter from the heaven to the earth; then it will ascend to Him in a Day, the extent of which is a thousand years of those which you count"}},{"ar":"إِدْبَٰر","kind":"verbal noun","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"decline, setting","word":null,"ex":{"s":52,"a":49,"p":4,"ar":["وَمِنَ","ٱلَّيْلِ","فَسَب